        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Man's bicorn silk hat, possibly made in Great Britain or France, ca. 1800"@en , "Man's bicorn hat in black silk trimmed with a silk button, black silk braid and a pleated silk cockade. High and semi-circular with one brim wider than the other. Trimmed with a loop of plaited silk braid stitched around a black silk covered button and over a stitched black grosgrain bow with van dyked edges. Lined with black silk."@en ;
